---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../utils/paths';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><BaseHead title="About — Jun Hong" description="Get to know Jun Hong and the purpose behind this personal space." /></head>
<body><Header /><main id="main-content">
<p class="eyebrow">Behind the page</p><h1>Hi, I’m Jun Hong.</h1>
<p class="lead">This is my space to learn out loud.</p>
<p>I built this website as a home for the things I’m passionate about and currently interested in. It’s a place to collect ideas, share what I’m working on, and keep a record of the journey.</p>
<h2>Around here</h2><p>You can explore my code on <a href="https://github.com/leclerc162003">GitHub</a> or browse <a href={sitePath('blog/')}>the notebook</a>. This space will grow as I do.</p>
<h2>Let’s connect</h2><p>If something here sparks a thought, I’d love to hear from you.</p><a class="email" href="mailto:lewischua.junhong@gmail.com">lewischua.junhong@gmail.com ↗</a>
</main><Footer /></body></html>
<style>main { padding-block: 5rem; min-height: 60vh; }h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; margin-block: 1.5rem; }.lead { font: italic 1.7rem Georgia, serif; color: var(--accent); }h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 3rem; }.email { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }</style>
